{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……好了，大家多保重』", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0708", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『期待我们还有再见的一天吧』", "text_idx": 152, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0709", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "伴随着校长的这番话，临时并校也迎来了尾声。", "text_idx": 154, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这结束语出乎意外地简洁，然后……在我心中留下了深深的余韵。", "text_idx": 155, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……结束后回头一看，还真是快啊」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1216", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊」", "text_idx": 159, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "临时并校从开始到现在共计两个月。", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "回过头来看，眨眼间便结束了。", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在这期间发生了各种各样的事情。", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "开心的事情，痛苦的事情，伤心的事情。", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，在这里度过的时光，\\n对我而言是非常重要的回忆。", "text_idx": 164, "plain": "但是，在这里度过的时光，对我而言是非常重要的回忆。", "plain_idx": 165, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真的已经结束了啊」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk4001", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊……我还有点没反应过来」", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5656", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。安洁也是」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3627", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我还觉得，等放完假回来之后，\\n　能再和大家相会」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": "「我还觉得，等放完假回来之后，　能再和大家相会」", "plain_idx": 177, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3628", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我倒是对回到了没有男人的安静的生活感到高兴」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn2224", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "连纱凪同学一贯的刀子嘴，也没了以往的锋利。", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生，你们在这之后该怎么办？」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5657", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们啊，因为今天就结束了，计划就是把行李处理好后，\\n　带着感激的心情，把使用过的地方给打扫干净」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": "「我们啊，因为今天就结束了，计划就是把行李处理好后，　带着感激的心情，把使用过的地方给打扫干净」", "plain_idx": 187, "len": 50, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……这样啊」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5658", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要大扫除的话，安洁也会来帮忙的！」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3629", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谢谢。但是……就今天，\\n　可不可以交给我们各务台的男生们呢？」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": "「谢谢。但是……就今天，　可不可以交给我们各务台的男生们呢？」", "plain_idx": 193, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样啊。那么就拜托你们了」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3630", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「给……这是学校的钥匙」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3631", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我轻轻接过被递过来的钥匙。", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这是……？」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要大扫除，钥匙还是有必要的」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3632", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……是啊」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这也是安洁信任我的证明吧。", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那钥匙就让我代为保管一段时间，可以吗？」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「当然可以」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3633", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁还拿有备用的，请不用担心。\\n　全部结束之后，劳烦你还回来哦」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": "「安洁还拿有备用的，请不用担心。　全部结束之后，劳烦你还回来哦」", "plain_idx": 208, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3634", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谢谢你，安洁」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
